[00:05.08]1. Jehovah, this is the day;
[00:11.42]Now from our hearts, we want to pray.
[00:17.76]How you have honored us, favored us,
[00:23.38]More than words can say!
[00:29.00]Upon our labor of love,
[00:35.23]We’ve seen your blessing from above.
[00:40.23]And now a building stands, by our hands,
[00:44.23]As the proof thereof.
[00:48.23](Chorus)
[00:52.23]Jehovah God, it was a priv’lege
[00:58.12]For us to build this place for you.
[01:04.12]May we continue in your service throughout our days
[01:13.12]And bring you praise in all we do.
[01:29.85]2. What happy faces we see,
[01:35.32]And what good friends we’ve come to be!
[01:41.28]And how we’ll cherish these memories
[01:47.23]For eternity!
[01:53.18]We saw your spirit, O Lord,
[01:59.13]In how we worked with one accord.
[02:05.37]And how we’ve added fame to your name;
[02:08.42]What a grand reward!
[02:11.48](Chorus)
[02:14.53]Jehovah God, it was a priv’lege
[02:17.58]For us to build this place for you.
[02:20.64]May we continue in your service throughout our days
[02:27.64]And bring you praise in all we do.